<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_jia_wood_the_dreamer', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Jia Wood – The Dreamer', 'zh' => '身弱甲木'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Attuned Jia Wood is akin to a young sapling – full of dreams and sensitivity, but not yet fully sturdy. Attuned Jia Wood feels external pressures easily. An idealist at heart, Attuned Jia Wood aspires high, yet Attuned Jia Wood is wise enough not to chase short-term heights obsessively. Real growth for Attuned Jia Wood comes from patiently nourishing its roots. By steadily grounding and accumulating knowledge, Attuned Jia Wood will eventually bear fruit upward. Though tender now, Attuned Jia Wood holds limitless potential – with the right support and timing, Attuned Jia Wood can thrive and become mighty.</p><p>Inherently kind: You operate by strong moral principles and feel a latent calling to serve the greater good.<br/>Idealistic dreamer: Your ambitions soar among the clouds, but in action you\'re easily swayed by outside influences.<br/>Steadfast when it counts: Despite a gentle exterior, you show astonishing grit in critical moments.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Water and Wood. Like a vine needing rain and a trellis, you benefit from nourishing Water and supportive Wood energies. Embracing these elements helps strengthen your resolve and foster steady growth from your natural flexibility.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You do well with collaborative wealth-building. Partnerships and mentors can greatly support you financially. Be on the lookout for mentors and benefactors (\'noble people\') and seize opportunities they bring. In your 20s, focus on building professional expertise; after your 30s, your good reputation will naturally start generating income streams. Slow and steady progress wins your financial race.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay special attention to your liver and gallbladder – eat light, clean foods and get to bed on time. Avoid greasy meals and late nights. Also, beware of a sedentary lifestyle: incorporate gentle movement to care for your muscles and joints. Guard your nervous system by relaxing your mind and ensuring enough sleep; stress management is key.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You\'re prone to feeling \'underappreciated\' or frustrated when your talents aren\'t recognized by the world. These bottled feelings can weigh you down. To release negativity, engage in grounding, earthy activities: practice Tai Chi or guided breathing exercises, volunteer in a tree-planting program, or do any hands-on activity that connects you with nature and community. Such down-to-earth practices will soothe your spirit and remind you that growth takes time.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Forestry & Landscape: Garden design, horticulture, floral business, forestry management – working with plants and nature suits your nurturing side. Health & Wellness: Traditional medicine, physical therapy, rehabilitation centers, wellness spas, yoga instruction, vegetarian food industry – fields where healing and gentle growth are valued. Textiles & Fashion: Clothing design or fabric trade – creative yet structured industries that let you express ideals in tangible form. Paper & Cultural Products: Stationery, publishing, books, cultural creative products – you appreciate the intellectual and artistic, and could find fulfillment here. Collaborative Platforms: Associations, clubs, or startup teams requiring tight-knit collaboration – you work well in close, supportive teams. Education: Schools, universities, training institutes, online learning platforms – educating and guiding others taps into your sense of purpose. Culture & Media: Publishing houses, writing, libraries, museums, journalism, content creation – places where you can quietly influence society with ideas. Consulting & Service: Counseling, advisory roles, nonprofit work – one-on-one or small group settings where empathy and guidance are key. Water & Environment: Water resource management, environmental protection, ecological restoration – aligning with your gentle nature and idealism. Research: Basic scientific research, philosophy, humanities and social science research – fields where deep thinking and patience yield results. Where Energy Feels Drained: Precision Manufacturing: Heavy machinery, large equipment fabrication – these could overwhelm your delicate sensibilities. High-Finance Consulting: Cut-throat investment banking or strategic consulting environments might stress you out. Tech Startup \'hustle\' culture: Roles like coder or social media influencer in ultra-competitive tech scenes can be destabilizing. Entertainment Industry: Careers in acting, hosting, modeling, or dance could bring unwanted volatility and scrutiny. Construction & Real Estate: Managing construction projects or real estate deals might feel too daunting or materialistic. Mining & Heavy Assets: Mining operations, big logistics warehouses – rough-and-tumble industries that don\'t align with your gentle strengths.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Gui Water: A friend who softens your stubborn idealism and boosts adaptability.</li><li>Bing Fire: An action-oriented friend who compensates for overthinking and sparks enthusiasm.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Ji Earth: A nurturing, practical partner who gives you deep security and helps process emotional ups and downs.</li><li>Ding Fire: A warm and inspiring partner who lights up your creativity and shows alternative perspectives.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Elon Musk: Entrepreneur spanning electric cars, space travel, and renewable energy (a big dreamer unafraid to innovate across domains)</li><li>Lionel Messi: Football superstar known for his innate talent and perseverance (quiet yet immensely impactful)</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Shi Tiesheng: Renowned writer who channeled personal struggles into profound literature (sensitive and idealistic spirit)</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Eat plenty of leafy green vegetables to nourish your Wood energy and keep your mood lifted</li><li>Go hiking or take nature walks whenever possible – connecting with the earth keeps you grounded and positive</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Teal (Wood): Teal blue-green enhances your decision-making and clarity. Wearing or surrounding yourself with a teal item (like a scarf or notebook) injects steady, vibrant energy, helping your thoughts stay clear and your actions decisive.</li><li>Green (Wood): Green increases warmth and closeness in relationships, smoothing communication and promoting harmony in life and teamwork. Use green décor or accessories to add a soothing, friendly vibe to your environment.</li><li>Blue (Water): Blue attracts mentors and benefactors and support. It symbolizes flow and assistance, making it easier for you to receive aid when needed. Placing a blue object in your home or workspace can naturally draw mentors and benefactors and opportunities to you.</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>East (Wood): Facing east energizes you to execute plans faster and more smoothly. If possible, orient your desk or work area eastward – you\'ll find your ability to follow through strengthened.</li><li>North (Water): North brings adaptable, flowing energy that improves your ability to handle change. Keep important items in the northern part of your space or spend time facing north – it\'s like introducing a flexible current into your life, helping you stay resilient through ups and downs.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>甲木如同参天大树的幼苗，身弱则承载力不足，力量尚未充盈，容易感受外界压力和影响。天性理想主义，敏感而富有梦想，但不宜执着于短期的高度。真正的成长在于积累自身的养分，向下扎根，稳固基础，再向上结果。</p><p>本质善良：处事讲求道义原则，具有服务大众的潜在使命感。<br/>理想主义：心怀凌云之志，但行动时易受外界影响，常在理想与现实之间挣扎。<br/>韧性坚毅：关键时刻显现惊人毅力，面对真正重视的事情能够坚定不移，如同种子破岩般突破困境。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱甲木，喜用水、木。如果能顺势运用这些元素，就能让自己的力量更平衡，也更容易发挥长处。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适合合作生财，易得贵人扶持，一定要看准机会好好把握。30岁前重在积累专业深度，40岁后依托口碑形成自然收益流。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>保护肝胆功能，注意饮食清淡，少熬夜、少吃油腻食物；避免久坐久站，适当活动，注意筋骨；注意神经问题，放松心情，保证充足睡眠。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>在很多人生境遇下，会产生\'怀才不遇\'的愤懑情绪。可以练习太极导引术，参与植树造林等接地气活动来疏解自身情绪。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：林业与园林业：园林设计、园艺、花卉、林业管理。健康与养生业：中医、理疗师、康复中心、养生馆、瑜伽、素食产业。纺织与服装业：服装设计、布料贸易。纸张与文创产业：文具、图书、文化创意产品。合作型平台：协会、俱乐部、需要团队紧密协作的初创企业。教育业：学校、大学、培训机构、在线教育平台。文化传媒业：出版、写作、图书馆、博物馆、新闻、内容创作者。咨询与服务业：心理咨询、顾问、非营利组织。水务与环保业：水利工程、水资源管理、环境保护、生态修复。科研行业：基础科学研究、哲学、人文社科研究。慎重行业：机械精密制造业：钢铁、机械加工、大型设备制造。金融咨询业：战略咨询、投行。互联网科技业：程序员、自媒体博主。娱乐演艺业：演员、主持人、模特、舞蹈家。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>癸水：能够帮助你化解理想主义的偏执，增强应变能力。</li><li>丙火：能够弥补你思多行少的缺陷，激发行动热情。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>己土：己土是包容务实的伴侣，既能给你提供安全感，又能帮助你化解情绪问题。</li><li>丁火：丁火能够点燃你的创造力，为你打开看事情的另一个视角。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Elon Musk：企业家，覆盖电动汽车、航天、可再生能源领域</li><li>Lionel Messi：足球巨星</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>史铁生：知名作家</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>吃绿叶蔬菜</li><li>可以多进行爬山/徒步等运动</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>青色（木）：多用青色可以增强决策力，让思路更清晰，行动更果断。</li><li>绿色（木）：使用绿色元素可增加人际亲近感，让沟通更顺畅，生活与合作更和谐。</li><li>蓝色（水）：蓝色能提升贵人缘，让你在工作和人际中更容易得到帮助与支持。</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>东方（木）：面向东方能增强执行力，让计划落地更快、更顺利。</li><li>北方（水）：在北方摆放关键工作物件，或朝北方向安排思考空间，都能提升判断力与决策力。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
